{"suttaId":"pv34","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Pv","vriCode":"s0507m.mul","paras":[1628,1654],"vripara":"499"},"segments":{"pv34:0.3":"Kūṭavinicchayikapetavatthu","pv34:1.1":"“Mālī kiriṭī kāyūrī [keyūrī (sī.)], gattā te candanussadā;","pv34:1.3":"Pasannamukhavaṇṇosi, sūriyavaṇṇova sobhasi.","pv34:2.1":"“Amānusā pārisajjā, ye teme paricārakā;","pv34:2.3":"Dasa kaññāsahassāni, yā temā paricārikā;","pv34:2.5":"Tā [kā (ka.)] kambukāyūradharā, kañcanāveḷabhūsitā.","pv34:3.1":"“Mahānubhāvosi tuvaṃ, lomahaṃsanarūpavā;","pv34:3.3":"Piṭṭhimaṃsāni attano, sāmaṃ ukkacca [ukkaḍḍha (sī.)] khādasi.","pv34:4.1":"“Kiṃ nu kāyena vācāya, manasā dukkuṭaṃ kataṃ;","pv34:4.3":"Kissa kammavipākena, piṭṭhimaṃsāni attano;","pv34:4.5":"Sāmaṃ ukkacca khādasī”ti.","pv34:5.1":"“Attanohaṃ anatthāya, jīvaloke acārisaṃ;","pv34:5.3":"Pesuññamusāvādena, nikativañcanāya ca.","pv34:6.1":"“Tatthāhaṃ parisaṃ gantvā, saccakāle upaṭṭhite;","pv34:6.3":"Atthaṃ dhammaṃ nirākatvā [niraṃkatvā (ka.) ni + ā + kara + tvā = nirākatvā], adhammamanuvattisaṃ.","pv34:7.1":"“Evaṃ so khādatattānaṃ, yo hoti piṭṭhimaṃsiko;","pv34:7.3":"Yathāhaṃ ajja khādāmi, piṭṭhimaṃsāni attano.","pv34:8.1":"“Tayidaṃ tayā nārada sāmaṃ diṭṭhaṃ, anukampakā ye kusalā vadeyyuṃ;","pv34:8.3":"Mā pesuṇaṃ mā ca musā abhāṇi, mā khosi piṭṭhimaṃsiko tuvan”ti.","pv34:9.1":"Kūṭavinicchayikapetavatthu navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Pv-a","bookName":"Petavatthu-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0507a.att","from":2231,"to":2234,"paras":[{"para":2231,"vripara":"499","refs":["pv34:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>mālī</b>ti māladhārī, dibbapupphehi paṭimaṇḍitoti adhippāyo.","<b>Kiriṭī</b>ti veṭhitasīso.","<b>Kāyūrī</b>ti keyūravā, bāhālaṅkārapaṭimaṇḍitoti attho.","<b>Gattā</b>ti sarīrāvayavā.","<b>Candanussadā</b>ti candanasārānulittā.","<b>Sūriyavaṇṇova sobhasī</b>ti bālasūriyasadisavaṇṇo eva hutvā virocasi.","“Araṇavaṇṇī pabhāsasī” tipi pāḷi, araṇanti araṇiyehi devehi sadisavaṇṇo ariyāvakāsoti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv34:1"],["pv34:1"],["pv34:1"],["pv34:1"],["pv34:1"],["pv34:1"],["pv34:1"]]},{"para":2232,"vripara":"500","refs":["pv34:2"],"lines":["<b>Pārisajjā</b>ti parisapariyāpannā, upaṭṭhākāti attho.","<b>Tuvan</b>ti tvaṃ.","<b>Lomahaṃsanarūpavā</b>ti passantānaṃ lomahaṃsajananarūpayutto.","Mahānubhāvatāsamaṅgitāya hetaṃ vuttaṃ.","<b>Ukkaccā</b>ti ukkantitvā, chinditvāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv34:2"],["pv34:2"],["pv34:2"],["pv34:2"],["pv34:2"]]},{"para":2233,"vripara":"503","refs":["pv34:5"],"lines":["<b>Acārisan</b>ti acariṃ paṭipajjiṃ.","<b>Pesuññamusāvādenā</b>ti pesuññena ceva musāvādena ca.","<b>Nikativañcanāya cā</b>ti nikatiyā vañcanāya ca patirūpadassanena paresaṃ vikārena vañcanāya ca."],"lineRefs":[["pv34:5"],["pv34:5"],["pv34:5"]]},{"para":2234,"vripara":"504","refs":["pv34:6"],"lines":["<b>Saccakāle</b>ti saccaṃ vattuṃ yuttakāle.","<b>Atthan</b>ti diṭṭhadhammikādibhedaṃ hitaṃ.","<b>Dhamman</b>ti kāraṇaṃ ñāyaṃ.","<b>Nirākatvā</b>ti chaḍḍetvā pahāya.","<b>So</b>ti yo pesuññādiṃ ācarati, so satto.","Sesaṃ sabbaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayameva."],"lineRefs":[["pv34:6"],["pv34:6"],["pv34:6"],["pv34:6"],["pv34:6"],["pv34:6"]]}],"wordLinks":[["pv34:1.1","mālī",0,0],["pv34:1.1","kiriṭī",0,1],["pv34:1.1","kāyūrī",0,2],["pv34:1.1","gattā",0,3],["pv34:1.1","candanussadā",0,4],["pv34:1.3","sūriyavaṇṇova sobhasī",0,5],["pv34:2.1","pārisajjā",1,0],["pv34:5.1","acārisaṃ",2,0],["pv34:5.3","pesuññamusāvādenā",2,1],["pv34:5.3","nikativañcanāya cā",2,2],["pv34:6.1","saccakāle",3,0],["pv34:6.3","atthaṃ",3,1],["pv34:6.3","dhammaṃ",3,2],["pv34:6.3","nirākatvā",3,3]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
